        {
          "printedRowIndex": 1,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 0,
          "text": "因此，流过负载的是声频电流，其振动形式几乎就是发射",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 2,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 1,
          "text": "台低频信号的再现（见图118а），可以把这个电流看作是直流",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 3,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 2,
          "text": "电（图118б）和低频交流电（图118в）的和。",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 4,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 0,
          "text": "最简单的检波接收机是由接",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 5,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 1,
          "text": "入天线的振荡回路、检波器及耳",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 6,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 2,
          "text": "机组合成的（图120）。耳机线圈",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 7,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 3,
          "text": "起负载的作用，声频电流从线圈",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 8,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 4,
          "text": "通过。不大的高频脉冲对振动膜",
          "parallelFragments": [
            {
              "sourceRef": "p0157#4",
              "kind": "cap",
              "lineIndex": 0,
              "text": "图　120"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 9,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 0,
          "text": "的振动没有明显的影响，并且也不能被听觉所感受。",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 10,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#6",
          "kind": "h3",
          "lineIndex": 0,
          "text": "60. 观察电磁波的性质",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 11,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 0,
          "text": "现代的无线电技术装置能用非常直观的实验来揭示电磁波的性",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 12,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 1,
          "text": "质。为此用专门的超高频振荡器发射的厘米波段的波是最好的。为了使",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 13,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 2,
          "text": "收到的信号在检波之后送到扬声器，用声频来调制振荡器的振荡。厘",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 14,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 3,
          "text": "米波段的电磁波在矩形截面的导管——**波导管**中能很好地传播。波导",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 15,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 4,
          "text": "管在末端变宽，形成向管轴方向发射无线电波的喇叭。接收天线也是",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 16,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 5,
          "text": "这样的喇叭，它接收沿喇叭轴传播的波。接收喇叭接在末端连有检波",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 17,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 6,
          "text": "装置的波导管上。此装置的全貌如图121所示。",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 18,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#9",
          "kind": "cap",
          "lineIndex": 0,
          "text": "图　121",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 19,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#10",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 0,
          "text": "为了演示波的**吸收**和**散射**，把两个喇叭相对放置，并在扬声器中得",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 20,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#10",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 1,
          "text": "到了声音的良好的可听度之后，在两个喇叭之间放各种不同的电介质，",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
        {
          "printedRowIndex": 21,
          "sourceRef": "p0157#10",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineIndex": 2,
          "text": "这样一来就可以发现响度减小了。",
          "parallelFragments": []
        },
